    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "I get that officials say that, but people are still seeing things that don't look right, like chain of custody issues or signatures not being checked properly. Isn't it a bit dismissive to just call all those concerns \"debunked\" without actually looking at the specific vulnerabilities people are pointing out?",
